@startuml native-interop
!pragma layout smetana
title M2 synchronous native ownership
interface IInspector
class NativeInspector {
  InspectAsync(job, samples, token)
  Dispose()
}
class NativeInspectorHandle {
  ReleaseHandle()
}
class SafeHandleZeroOrMinusOneIsInvalid
class NativeMethods {
  LibraryImport declarations
}
class "inspection_handle (C++)" as NativeObject
NativeInspector ..|> IInspector
NativeInspector *-- NativeInspectorHandle : owns
NativeInspectorHandle --|> SafeHandleZeroOrMinusOneIsInvalid
NativeInspector --> NativeMethods : synchronous Run
NativeInspectorHandle --> NativeMethods : Destroy
NativeMethods ..> NativeObject : C ABI create / run / destroy
note right of NativeInspector
Host owns the adapter.
Runner borrows IInspector.
Input buffer pinned only during Run.
No worker thread or retained pointer.
end note
note bottom of NativeInspectorHandle
P/Invoke SafeHandle marshaling protects each call.
Dispose releases deterministically;
finalization is a fallback.
end note
@enduml
